cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NeoStay in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "NeoStay: Infant NICU Outcome and Staffing Intelligence"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Waseem
    family-names: Altaf
  - given-names: Abdul
    family-names: Razak
abstract: >-
  NeoStay is a research and decision-support prototype that forecasts length of
  stay, disposition, survival and nurse staffing for Very Low Birth Weight
  infants from aggregated neonatal outcome statistics. It is not a medical
  device and must never replace clinical judgment.
  Project and Clinical Lead: Waseem Altaf, MD, Neonatologist.
  Technical Lead and Lead Developer: Abdul Razak, PhD.
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdulrazakucc/patient-nurse-schedule"
url: "https://abdulrazakucc.github.io/patient-nurse-schedule/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - neonatal intensive care
  - very low birth weight
  - length of stay
  - nurse staffing
  - decision support
